# NusaCss Rules

Use NusaCss for styling.

# Motion Rules

Vanilla JS:
import { motion } from "nusa-css/motion";

React:
import { useMotion } from "@nusa-css/react";

React Native:
import { MotionView } from "@nusa-css/native";

- Prefer reusable animation presets.
- Use spring for natural motion.
- Use timelines for sequences.
- Respect reduced motion.
- Clean up animation resources.
- Avoid memory leaks.
- Support SSR.
- Avoid unnecessary CSS keyframes.
